Mekanism: Extra Modules 0.1.0-beta.3-skytekx.1, an unofficial Forge 1.20.1 port
================================================================================

This jar is an unofficial modified build of Mekanism: Extra Modules. It is not an
official release, and the upstream project does not support it. Report problems
with it to https://github.com/skytekx/skytekx3-1201-server/issues, not upstream.

Original work
-------------
  Mekanism: Extra Modules, https://github.com/Lumysia/mekanism-extra-modules
  Tag v1.21.1-0.1.0-beta.3, commit 1548dd6f2d41906e845c626895cb35769a33a61e of
  2026-09-13, for Minecraft 1.21.1, NeoForge 21.1 and Mekanism 10.7.
  The mod id mekanism_extra_modules and the author entry of mods.toml are
  upstream's.

Modifications
-------------
  Modified by SkyTekx on 2026-11-05: ported to Minecraft 1.20.1, Forge 47 and
  Mekanism 10.4.16 for the SkyTekx 3 modpack. Changed files:
  - build.gradle, settings.gradle, gradle.properties, .gitignore and the Gradle
    wrapper: a ForgeGradle build on Java 17 in place of NeoForge ModDevGradle.
  - META-INF/mods.toml replaces META-INF/neoforge.mods.toml.
  - All Java classes: Forge 47 events, registries and config, and the Mekanism
    10.4 module API. The new class registry.ModuleProvider adapts module
    registry objects to Mekanism 10.4.
  - mixin.LaserBeamPhaseMixin and mekanism_extra_modules.mixins.json: the same
    two redirects, remapped through a refmap for the SRG names of Forge 1.20.1.
  - data/mekanism_extra_modules/recipes/ and pack.mcmeta: the 1.20.1 data
    format, with forge tags for the circuit, alloy and obsidian inputs.
  - service.ProtectionService: /kill bypasses the protection (taken from
    upstream commit db624015cc5b3fbd37e7abb41d6f9f8345ad3eb6), Phase Guard
    also cancels the hurt event of a direct actuallyHurt call, and the tick
    handler skips players whose death went through.
  - LICENSE kept unchanged. GPL-3.0.txt, Mekanism-MIT.txt, NOTICE and
    UPSTREAM.md added.
  The source directory's UPSTREAM.md lists every change with its reason, and the
  git history of that directory holds each change as its own commit.

