Corresponding Source
--------------------
  The complete source of this jar, with the Gradle build that makes it, is the
  directory ports/mekanism-extra-modules of the SkyTekx 3 repository:
    https://github.com/skytekx/skytekx3-1201-server/tree/master/ports/mekanism-extra-modules
  The exact source of a given jar is that directory at the commit that last
  changed the jar in local-mods/ of the same repository. The SkyTekx 3 modpack
  also carries a zip of that directory in licenses/. The build is byte
  reproducible, so a rebuild can be checked against the SHA-1 of the jar.

Mekanism (MIT)
--------------
  The three item textures textures/item/chaos_anchor_unit.png,
  emergency_revival_unit.png and phase_guard_unit.png are edited copies of
  Mekanism's textures/item/module_base.png. gui/hud/emergency_revival_unit.png
  is a copy of Mekanism's gui/hud/nutritional_injection_unit.png, and
  gui/hud/phase_guard_unit.png is a recolor of Mekanism's
  gui/hud/gravitational_modulation_unit.png. Mekanism
  (https://github.com/mekanism/Mekanism) is MIT licensed, and its copyright
  and permission notice is LICENSE_mekanism_extra_modules_Mekanism-MIT. No
  Mekanism code is copied. The mod only calls the Mekanism API.

Draconic Evolution
------------------
  The optional Draconic Evolution integration is one mixin with two redirects
  into LaserBeamPhase.serverTick of an installed Draconic Evolution. This jar
  contains no Draconic Evolution code or data, and it does not need Draconic
  Evolution to load.
